### Health — GET /actuator/health
# Whether the service and each of its parts is up. Answers to anyone reaching the port. What each state of the
# change-capture component means: ../../contracts/in/operations.md

@host = http://localhost:1010

### The whole aggregate, with every component.
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### Readiness alone, as a probe reads it.
GET {{host}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Liveness alone.
GET {{host}}/actuator/health/liveness
